; "it" — singular object pronoun, third person neuter
; signals: reference to the most recently established entity or result
; it IS naama-pratibodha expressed as an English pronoun
; example: "find the kinetic energy. what is IT in joules?"
; → [it, naama-pratibodha, kinetic-energy]

(bhasha pronoun-it
  (swarupa avyaya)
  (sthita english naama-pratibodha eka-vachana))
